        "faq1": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is there any alcohol or THC in SocialVia?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>SocialVia won't get you high, and it does not give you a buzz. It does not work the way alcohol, opioids, or THC work. It turns on the happy part of your brain without making you sloppy or under the influence.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq2": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "When should I drink SocialVia?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Before going out. Before a date. Before a meeting. Before a dinner. Before catching up with old friends. Whenever you want to be more outgoing, relaxed, and fun around people.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq3": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What does it feel like?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>You don't feel buzzed or sloppy. When you drink SocialVia you feel relaxed, focused, happier, and more outgoing. It's not an overpowering feeling, but it's enough to enjoy being around people more than usual.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq4": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How does it taste?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>It's an Açaí Mixed Berry with a tangy, sweet, and slightly bitter finish. A lot of customers mix it with juice or lemonade to enjoy it as a delicious mocktail.</p>"
          }
        }
